<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1458638381"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Old Town Road (feat. Billy Ray Cyrus) [Remix]"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lil Nas X"/><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v3"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2000"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">是啊，我要骑着我的马去老城路</text><text for="L2">我要一路驰骋，直到再也骑不动</text><text for="L3">是啊，我要骑着我的马去老城路</text><text for="L4">我要一路驰骋，直到再也骑不动</text><text for="L5">Kio，Kio</text><text for="L6">我的马儿都在后头</text><text for="L7">马具全都备好了</text><text for="L8">帽子哑光纯黑</text><text for="L9">配着双黑色靴子</text><text for="L10">骑在马背上，哈</text><text for="L11">你尽管飙你的保时捷</text><text for="L12">我一直在山谷里</text><text for="L13">你连那门廊都没下去过吧</text><text for="L14">没人能对我说三道四</text><text for="L15">你也别想对我指手画脚</text><text for="L16">没人能对我说三道四</text><text for="L17">你也别想对我指手画脚</text><text for="L18">开着拖拉机一路颠</text><text for="L19">膀胱里全是紫水</text><text for="L20">我背着我宝贝偷腥</text><text for="L21">你可以去问问她</text><text for="L22">我的人生就像电影</text><text for="L23">骑牛大赛和大胸</text><text for="L24">古驰的牛仔帽</text><text for="L25">屁股上套着 Wrangler 牛仔裤</text><text for="L26">没人能对我说三道四</text><text for="L27">你也别想对我指手画脚</text><text for="L28">没人能对我说三道四</text><text for="L29">你也别想对我指手画脚</text><text for="L30">是啊，我要骑着我的马去老城路</text><text for="L31">我要一路驰骋，直到再也骑不动</text><text for="L32">是啊，我要骑着我的马去老城路</text><text for="L33">我要一路驰骋，直到再也骑不动</text><text for="L34">压低帽檐，穿城而过，活得像摇滚明星</text><text for="L35">为我的新吉他花了大把钱</text><text for="L36">宝贝的癖好：钻戒和芬迪运动内衣</text><text for="L37">开着玛莎拉蒂跑车驰过罗迪欧大道</text><text for="L38">毫无压力，那些我早都经历过了</text><text for="L39">我就像万宝路牛仔，往后一靠，悠哉快活</text><text for="L40">多想再回到那条老城路</text><text for="L41">我想一直骑，直到再也骑不动</text><text for="L42">是啊，我要骑着我的马去老城路</text><text for="L43">我要一路驰骋，直到再也骑不动</text><text for="L44">是啊，我要骑着我的马去老城路</text><text for="L45">我要一路驰骋，直到再也骑不动</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Atticus Matthew Ross</songwriter><songwriter>Billy Ray Cyrus</songwriter><songwriter>Jocelyn Adriene Donald</songwriter><songwriter>Kiowa Roukema</songwriter><songwriter>Montero Lamar Hill</songwriter><songwriter>Trent Reznor</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:37.067"><div begin="12.701" end="27.649" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="12.701" end="16.925" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="12.701" end="13.514">Yeah,</span> <span begin="13.514" end="13.714">I'm</span> <span begin="13.714" end="14.164">gonna</span> <span begin="14.164" end="14.596">take</span> <span begin="14.596" end="15.028">my</span> <span begin="15.028" end="15.463">horse</span> <span begin="15.463" end="15.663">to</span> <span begin="15.663" end="15.898">the</span> <span begin="15.898" end="16.114">old</span> <span begin="16.114" end="16.514">town</span> <span begin="16.514" end="16.925">road</span></p><p begin="16.938" end="20.562" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="16.938" end="17.209">I'm</span> <span begin="17.209" end="17.656">gonna</span> <span begin="18.060" end="18.943">ride</span> <span begin="18.943" end="19.159">till</span> <span begin="19.159" end="19.393">I</span> <span begin="19.393" end="19.825">can't</span> <span begin="19.825" end="20.260">no</span> <span begin="20.260" end="20.562">more</span></p><p begin="20.572" end="23.942" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="20.572" end="20.729">I'm</span> <span begin="20.729" end="21.161">gonna</span> <span begin="21.161" end="21.595">take</span> <span begin="21.595" end="22.046">my</span> <span begin="22.046" end="22.513">horse</span> <span begin="22.513" end="22.713">to</span